      "excerpt": "8-member SM girl group debut. Title track The Chase plus B-side Butterflies inside.",
      "quote": "Chase your choice — Hearts2Hearts is here!",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kxUA2wwYiME/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Hearts2Hearts have officially debuted on Feb 24, 2025 with single album The Chase, first SM girl group since aespa.",
        "Album contains title track The Chase and B-side Butterflies, with dreamy soundscapes and vocal melodies.",
        "Group held debut showcase at Yes24 Live Hall in Seoul and revealed fandom name S2U.",
        "Physical album certified Platinum by KMCA."
      ]
    },
