      "title": "Hearts2Hearts Release First EP 'FOCUS'!",
      "excerpt": "Pre-release Pretty Please plus title track FOCUS. Apple Pie, Flutter, Blue Moon inside.",
      "quote": "Focus on Hearts2Hearts!",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ur7aK4FvK-U/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Hearts2Hearts released first EP FOCUS on Oct 20, 2025 after pre-release Pretty Please on Sep 24.",
        "EP holds FOCUS, Apple Pie, Flutter, Blue Moon and peaked at No.3 on albums chart.",
        "Title track FOCUS peaked at No.14 on singles chart.",
        "Group named best new artist at MAMA, Melon, Seoul Music Awards 2025."
